<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    </head>
    <body style="margin: 0">
        <div
            style="
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 24px;
                padding: 20px 0;
                width: 100%;
            "
        >
            <style>
                @keyframes pulse-border {
                    0% {
                        box-shadow: 0 0 0 0px #9cc5a1;
                    }
                    30% {
                        box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(127, 119, 221, 0);
                    }
                    100% {
                        box-shadow: 0 0 0 0px rgba(127, 119, 221, 0);
                    }
                }

                .grep-col {
                    display: flex;
                    align-items: center;
                    justify-content: center;
                    width: 50%;
                    font-family: monospace;
                    font-size: 32px;
                    color: #555;
                }
                .text-col {
                    width: 50%;
                    border: 0.5px solid #aaa;
                    border-radius: 18px;
                    padding: 24px 32px;
                    cursor: default;
                    font-family: sans-serif;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    color: #555;
                    text-align: center;
                    box-sizing: border-box;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    animation: pulse-border 2s ease-out infinite;
                }
                .row {
                    display: flex;
                    width: 99%;
                }

                /* highlight */
                .word-hl {
                    display: inline;
                    background-image: linear-gradient(#9cc5a1, #9cc5a1);
                    background-size: 0% 100%;
                    background-repeat: no-repeat;
                    background-position: left center;
                    border-radius: 3px;
                    transition:
                        color 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                        background-size 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
                }
                .text-col:hover .word-hl {
                    color: #216869;
                    background-size: 100% 100%;
                }
            </style>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="grep-col">\d{4}</div>
                <div class="text-col">
                    In November <span class="word-hl">2008</span>, as Wall
                    Street teetered on the brink, turnout reached 61.6 percent
                    of the eligible voting-age population. In
                    <span class="word-hl">2020</span> it hit 66 percent, the
                    highest proportion of Americans to cast a vote for a
                    presidential candidate since
                    <span class="word-hl">1900</span>, receding slightly in
                    <span class="word-hl">2024</span> to 64 percent, the second
                    highest in over a century.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>
